translation.pluginMarketplace.deletePluginTitle	Delete {{name}}?
translation.pluginMarketplace.deletePluginDescription	This plugin was uploaded here, so it has no other copy. Its files are permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.
translation.pluginMarketplace.deletePlaybooksTitle	Delete the Playbooks plugin?
